Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: s4bridge
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, python3-pyside6.qtsvg,
 python3-pyside6.qtnetwork, python3-evdev, libasound2t64 | libasound2
Recommends: mixxx, python3-numpy, python3-scipy, python3-jack-client, pipewire-jack
Description: use the original Traktor Kontrol S4 (MK1) with Mixxx and any MIDI software
 The original Traktor Kontrol S4 only ever worked with Traktor. S4 Bridge turns it into a
 full MIDI controller with LED feedback for Mixxx, DAWs and any MIDI software.
